            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sandra G"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A very nice way to eat courgettes. I didn't have a Blue, and was too lazy to go out and buy, so I used a mix of Emmenthal and Parmesan. But the next time I will make sure I have a bit of Roquefort on hand. It would be even nicer, I am sure.",
