            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "France C"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A great way to jazz up plain old zucchini, especially when your garden is overflowing! The only thing I suggest is to season the zucchini with salt and pepper when sauteeing. The blue cheese is the perfect compliment to the tomatoes and zucchini. Everyone loved it.",
